    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ryan Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 4 The Ropery, an impressive A3-rated, four-bedroom, three-bathroom home extending to approximately 130 sq. m. (1,399 sq. ft.).\r\nArranged over three floors, the property offers generous and versatile accommodation together with two private outdoor terraces and a designated parking space. The Ropery is an exclusive development of just nine contemporary homes, ideally situated in the heart of Dublin 4."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n2.36m x 1.40m, plus 4.48m x 1.12m\r\nLaminate flooring, recessed lighting, storage cupboard and understairs storage.\r\nBathroom\r\n2.22m x 1.70m\r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, WC, wash-hand basin, bath with overhead shower, heated towel rail and wall-mounted mirror.\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.68m x 3.35m\r\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes and access to the terrace.\r\nEn Suite\r\n2.22m x 1.24m\r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, WC, wash-hand basin, shower enclosure, heated towel rail and wall-mounted mirror.\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.56m x 3.41m (average)\r\nCarpet flooring and fitted wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.71m x 3.24m\r\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes and access to the terrace.\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nLanding\r\n2.40m x 1.18m\r\nCarpet flooring and storage cupboard.\r\nKitchen\r\n3.20m x 2.93m\r\nTiled floor, fitted wall and floor units, Silestone quartz worktops, integrated oven, hob, extractor fan, fridge-freezer, dishwasher and washing machine. Recessed lighting and roof light.\r\nLiving/Dining Room\r\n6.76m x 3.80m\r\nLaminate flooring, recessed lighting and floor-to-ceiling glazing. Bespoke media wall incorporating a contemporary electric fire and access to the upper terrace.\r\nSECOND FLOOR\r\nLanding\r\n3.78m x 1.12m\r\nCarpet flooring and storage cupboard.\r\nBedroom 4\r\n4.15m x 3.67m\r\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes and recessed lighting.\r\nEn Suite\r\n2.41m x 2.13m\r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, WC, wash-hand basin, shower enclosure, heated towel rail and wall-mounted mirror.\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nGround-Floor Terrace\r\n4.00m x 3.13m\r\nTiled terrace with an outside water tap.\r\nUpper Terrace\r\n3.90m x 3.60m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with a storage cupboard and additional understairs storage. There are three bedrooms at this level, all with fitted wardrobes, including one en-suite bedroom. Two of the bedrooms provide direct access to the ground-floor terrace. A well-appointed family bathroom completes the ground-floor accommodation.\r\nThe first floor is dedicated to the living accommodation. The bright and spacious open-plan living and dining room spans the full width of the property and benefits from floor-to-ceiling glazing and direct access to the upper terrace. A particular highlight is the bespoke media wall incorporating a contemporary electric fire, creating an impressive focal point and adding warmth and character to the living space.\r\nThe separate kitchen is fitted with an extensive range of contemporary wall and floor units, Silestone quartz worktops and integrated appliances. A large roof light provides excellent natural light.\r\nThe second floor comprises a spacious fourth bedroom with fitted wardrobes and a generously sized en-suite bathroom.\r\nThe property enjoys an exceptionally convenient location close to Grand Canal Dock, Ballsbridge, Sandymount, Ringsend and Dublin city centre. Some of Dublin’s leading employers, including Google and Meta, are within walking distance, while the surrounding area offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and entertainment venues.\r\nThe Bord Gáis Energy Theatre, Aviva Stadium and the waterfront at Grand Canal Dock are all nearby. Grand Canal Dock DART Station, Dublin Bus services and Dublin Bikes provide convenient access throughout the city and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A3"
      }
